    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a complicated relationship with mathematics. While I appreciate its precision and logic, it often feels abstract and overwhelming. My parents' high education levels might have set unrealistic expectations for my own academic performance in math, which adds pressure. I prefer subjects like physics or history where concepts feel more tangible and connected to real-world applications.",
