    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I did experiment with AI tools like Khan Academy’s practice modules and Wolfram Alpha for solving equations. The experience was mixed—some explanations were clear and helpful, but others felt too technical or overwhelming. I prefer human guidance when I’m stuck, as it helps me understand the ‘why’ behind the steps.",
